WEBVTT

1
00:00:11.007 --> 00:00:19.337
It was Tom's birthday.

2
00:00:19.338 --> 00:00:25.286
"Happy Birthday!" Mrs. Twitchit said.

3
00:00:25.287 --> 00:00:35.627
She gave Tom a gift.

4
00:00:35.628 --> 00:00:38.979
Tom opened his gift.

5
00:00:38.980 --> 00:00:41.339
"A new ball!"

6
00:00:41.340 --> 00:00:49.420
The ball was bright yellow.

7
00:00:49.421 --> 00:00:52.971
"Let's go play catch," Mittens said.

8
00:00:52.972 --> 00:00:55.392
"Fun!" Tom said.

9
00:00:55.393 --> 00:00:59.538
"You can go outside," Mrs. Twitchit said.

10
00:00:59.539 --> 00:01:01.319
"But don't go far.

11
00:01:01.320 --> 00:01:18.886
Tom's party is at three o'clock."

12
00:01:18.887 --> 00:01:28.939
The kittens went outside.

13
00:01:28.940 --> 00:01:32.399
They played catch with the ball.

14
00:01:32.400 --> 00:01:35.462
"Throw the ball to me!" Moppet said.

15
00:01:35.463 --> 00:01:38.197
She held up her paws.

16
00:01:38.198 --> 00:01:42.981
She jumped up and down.

17
00:01:42.982 --> 00:01:45.291
Tom threw the ball.

18
00:01:45.292 --> 00:01:47.338
Moppet missed.

19
00:01:47.339 --> 00:01:52.087
The ball landed behind a big bush.

20
00:01:52.088 --> 00:01:54.647
Moppet looked at Mittens.

21
00:01:54.648 --> 00:01:57.227
"Can you get the ball?"

22
00:01:57.228 --> 00:01:59.776
"No!" Mittens said.

23
00:01:59.777 --> 00:02:02.079
"You're the one who missed it!"

24
00:02:02.080 --> 00:02:04.661
Moppet put her paws on her hips.

25
00:02:04.662 --> 00:02:07.094
"Tom is the one who threw it!

26
00:02:07.095 --> 00:02:11.604
Tom, go get the ball!"

27
00:02:11.612 --> 00:02:17.021
The kittens fought for a while.

28
00:02:17.022 --> 00:02:24.352
Finally Tom went to get the ball.

29
00:02:24.353 --> 00:02:27.055
He peeked behind the bush.

30
00:02:27.056 --> 00:02:33.969
Tom gasped. "My ball is gone!"
